sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as TUI / IDE client
    participant Session as Live Session
    participant Context as Context + tool builder
    participant Model as Model provider
    participant Router as Tool router / registry
    participant Tool as Tool runtime
    participant Store as Rollout / thread store

    Client->>Session: Op::UserTurn
    Session->>Context: resolve settings + build size-governed input
    Context-->>Session: prompt + selected tool specifications
    Session->>Model: streaming sampling request
    Model-->>Client: assistant text/item deltas
    Model-->>Session: ResponseItem::FunctionCall(call_id)
    Session->>Router: build ToolCall + ToolInvocation
    Router-->>Client: tool started event
    Router->>Tool: execute(call_id, cancellation token)
    Tool-->>Router: typed output or error
    Router-->>Store: record selected call/result/lifecycle items
    Router-->>Client: tool completed event
    Router-->>Session: FunctionCallOutput(same call_id)
    Session->>Model: next sampling request with tool output
    alt more tool calls
        Model-->>Session: another tool-call item
    else final response
        Model-->>Client: final assistant item + turn completed
        Session-->>Store: persist terminal turn state
    end
